<title>USA: CCC buys 3,000 tonnes U.S. sunoil for Mozambique.</title>
<headline>CCC buys 3,000 tonnes U.S. sunoil for Mozambique.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp of the U.S. Department of Agriculture said it had purchased 3,000 tonnes of U.S. sunflowerseed oil from ADM Bulk Oils for export to Mozambique, priced at $509.60 per tonne, FOB New Orleans.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720))</p>
</text>
